# Phases of U-Boot which run before U-Boot proper (xPL), in the order in which
# they run
#
# Each line describes one phase:
#
#   name	Name of the phase, which is also the name of its build directory
#		and, in upper case, the prefix of its Kconfig options, so 'tpl'
#		builds in tpl/ and uses options such as CONFIG_TPL_SERIAL
#   tag		Devicetree property which marks the nodes the phase needs
#
# A phase is enabled by the Kconfig option with its upper-case name, e.g.
# CONFIG_TPL. When it runs, a phase moves on to the next enabled phase in this
# list, with U-Boot proper coming after the last one.

tpl	bootph-pre-sram
vpl	bootph-verify
spl	bootph-pre-ram
